    BaseType == "Sage's Robe" "Crusader Plate" "Lacquered Garb" "Scholar's Robe" "Harlequin Mask" "Gilded Sallet" "Zodiac Leather" "Spidersilk Robe" "Wyrmscale Doublet" "Elegant Round Shield" "Astral Plate" "Sorcerer Boots" "Archon Kite Shield" "Desert Brigandine" "Golden Mask" "Ezomyte Tower Shield" "Champion Kite Shield" "Titanium Spirit Shield" "Raven Mask" "Murder Mitts" "Rawhide Boots" "Praetor Crown" "Steel Kite Shield" "Silken Vest" "Gladiator Plate" "Royal Burgonet"
